Supplemental K-12 school facilities 25LSO-0596, 1.1
appropriations-2.
FISCAL NOTE
This bill contains an appropriation of $31,622,679 from the PUBLIC SCHOOL FOUNDATION
PROGRAM ACCOUNT to the School Facilities Commission to supplement K-12 school
facilities appropriations for the FY 2025-2026 biennium, effective immediately, for
the following purposes:
• $29,832,716 for component level major maintenance projects; and
• $1,789,963 for unanticipated costs.
This bill reappropriates up to $13,400,000 or as much thereof is available from
2023 Wyoming Session Laws, Chapter 94, Section 313(j)(xiii), effective immediately,
to the School Facilities Commission to supplement previous appropriations for
inflationary costs associated with projects approved by the commission and funded
by the Legislature.
